{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以諸佛法身。本無\n形相。恐成斷滅故。以音聲假詮表之。詮佛語言。即文殊聲也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯北臺中臺。古時有異。東西二臺古今無異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "力鬼切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孝文封為南岳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所錦切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今為尼院"}
